      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have a really bad UTI going on... burning when i pee and i feel like i gotta go every 5 mins. i found some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) in my cabinet from a few months ago. is it okay if i just take 100mg twice a day to get rid of it? i dont really wanna go to the doctor if i dont have to. (just a heads up i do have stage 3 kidney disease but i think it should be fine)",
