    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're an ai but i'm just looking for info. i've had stage 3 for a bit and my doctor said it's stable, so i don't want to make a big deal out of a simple infection. if i just take a slightly lower dose, like 50mg instead of 100mg, is that generally considered safer for people with my kidney stuff? i just really want to avoid the clinic if i can manage it myself.",
